# The package tree mirrors the Debian filesystem, so its usr/lib/ is not a
# build output: re-include it under the root **/lib/ rule. The offload sandbox
# images never see this file (their .dockerignore is derived from the root
# .gitignore alone), so scripts/generate_dockerignore.sh re-includes the same
# path in docker form; keep the two together.
!tree/usr/lib/
